  "translation": "Waati laban na, masakɛ min bɛ worodugu fɛ (Negɛb) bɛna kɔngɔn ka n'a ta kɛ ɲɔgɔn ye; masakɛ min bɛ saheli fɛ bɛna iko jaɲɛsi-na a kan, ni wɔrɔdalanw ni so-nyɛmininw ni kwɛn caman ye; a na jamana caman don, a bɛna u siri iko sanji jaɲɛsi, ka taa yɔrɔ caman.",
